    "created_at": "2020-06-22T08:22:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-22T08:25:30Z",
    "body": "> I know we have issues with cargo-cross and the cross-platform build chains, but _surely_ we could do this one just by modifying our GH Actions right?\r\n\r\nSeems like a 2-3 line addition : `i686-unknown-linux-gnu`\r\n\r\n```yml\r\n        target:\r\n          - x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu\r\n          - i686-unknown-linux-gnu\r\n          - x86_64-unknown-linux-musl\r\n          - x86_64-apple-darwin\r\n          - x86_64-pc-windows-msvc\r\n        include:\r\n          - target: x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu\r\n            os: ubuntu-latest\r\n            name: starship-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz\r\n          - target: i686-unknown-linux-gnu\r\n            os: ubuntu-latest\r\n            name: starship-i686-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz\r\n          - target: x86_64-unknown-linux-musl\r\n            os: ubuntu-latest\r\n            name: starship-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz\r\n          - target: x86_64-apple-darwin\r\n            os: macOS-latest\r\n            name: starship-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz\r\n          - target: x86_64-pc-windows-msvc\r\n            os: windows-latest\r\n            name: starship-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip\r\n```\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
